        "title": "Normalize deep link scheme and host",
        "body": "Closes #2\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nFixes case-sensitive deep link dispatch in `AppMain`.\r\n\r\n`application(_:open:)` now lowercases both the URL scheme and host before matching, so links such as `Nameplate://config`, `nameplate://Config` and `Nameplate://Settings` are routed correctly instead of being silently ignored.\r\n\r\nThis keeps AppMain consistent with `ConfigProposal`, which already normalizes scheme and host internally.\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\n- `swift build`\r\n- `git diff --check`\r\n",
